  <h2 id="choice">Shower, bath or both?</h2>
  <p>Anyone renovating a bathroom in the Axarquía faces the same question: keep the bath, go for a walk-in shower, or add a rain shower? The answer depends on who uses the bathroom. Do you live there yourself, let to holiday guests or run a B&B? And how much water and space do you have?</p>
  <p>Spanish homes from the 1970s to 2000s often have a small bath with a shower head above it. That is the bathroom most buyers tackle first. Below we put all the options side by side.</p>

  <h2 id="comparison">All options compared</h2>
  <p>Below, for each option, the water use and what it is good at.</p>
